{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/extras/ProjectFleetInfoE.png?t=1748809905\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Project Fleet is a 2D sci-fi real-time strategy, puzzler, fleet management, autobattler. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're getting a part of rebellion against the Empire and want to make a name for yourself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Project Fleet, you raid one planet after another in rouge-lite style. However, the enemies won't make it easy and will try to stop you. You're also constantly on the run from the Empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Make a name for yourself, trade with NPCs, and expand your base and hangar! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/extras/ProjectFleetInfo.png?t=1748809905\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place Spaceships you equipped in your Hangar onto the Gridbased Battlefield. Formations bring extra rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/extras/formation-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1748809905\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are four classes: Gatherers, Fighters, Supporters and the Factory. Each class brings its own abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Gatherers</strong> increase your shield. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Fighters</strong> use shield energy to attack the enemy. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Supporters</strong> are slow attackers without\u00a0</i>additional cost<i>. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Factories</i></strong><i>\u00a0use shield energy, produce money and collect resources.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are six levels of planets <i>(12 different planets in total)</i> to conquer and their resources to plunder. Each level becomes more difficult than the one before it. There are also numerous events to overcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/extras/ProjectFleetInfofeat.png?t=1748809905\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Story Mode and Highscore Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-12 different Planets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Numerous Events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-28 Spaceships</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-4 Traders and Quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-different PowerUps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-different Base Expansions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-a unique Gameplay</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3711690?t=1748809905","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/c84b08e04dcc4428ee3108600df32ace9c224fe0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748809905","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/a6a21d12cb49df9355986cfac1d820c66861842a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748809905","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/a6a21d12cb49df9355986cfac1d820c66861842a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748809905","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/extras/ProjectFleetInfoE.png?t=1748809905\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Project Fleet is a 2D sci-fi real-time strategy, puzzler, fleet management, autobattler. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're getting a part of rebellion against the Empire and want to make a name for yourself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Project Fleet, you raid one planet after another in rouge-lite style. However, the enemies won't make it easy and will try to stop you. You're also constantly on the run from the Empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Make a name for yourself, trade with NPCs, and expand your base and hangar! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/extras/ProjectFleetInfo.png?t=1748809905\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place Spaceships you equipped in your Hangar onto the Gridbased Battlefield. Formations bring extra rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/extras/formation-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1748809905\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are four classes: Gatherers, Fighters, Supporters and the Factory. Each class brings its own abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Gatherers</strong> increase your shield. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Fighters</strong> use shield energy to attack the enemy. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Supporters</strong> are slow attackers without\u00a0</i>additional cost<i>. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Factories</i></strong><i>\u00a0use shield energy, produce money and collect resources.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are six levels of planets <i>(12 different planets in total)</i> to conquer and their resources to plunder. Each level becomes more difficult than the one before it. There are also numerous events to overcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/extras/ProjectFleetInfofeat.png?t=1748809905\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Story Mode and Highscore Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-12 different Planets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Numerous Events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-28 Spaceships</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-4 Traders and Quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-different PowerUps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-different Base Expansions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-a unique Gameplay</p>","developers":["ArntWorks Development"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711690/0c8ca7d91e6e18290f590e47e2f62b3286aeee0b/header.jpg?t=1748809905","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257141362,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141362/movie480.mp4?t=1748262703","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141362/movie_max.mp4?t=1748262703"},"name":"Project Fleet Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257141362/9d79e39c07c9186062000ac4f192ab1a36e358d4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748262703","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141362/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748262703","max"